WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.102
Annie didn't stop swinging her tail.

2
00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:10.211
Bam! Boom!

3
00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:16.000
Small rocks fell.

4
00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:21.714
"Roar!" Rex cried.

5
00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:24.056
More rocks fell!

6
00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.252
"Oops," Rex said.

7
00:00:27.253 --> 00:00:30.348
Annie stopped swinging her tail.

8
00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:33.782
"What's wrong, Rex?" she asked.

9
00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:37.051
"Rocks are falling," Rex said.

10
00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:40.933
"You can't swing your tail."

11
00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:44.014
Annie shrugged. "Fine.

12
00:00:44.015 --> 00:00:50.919
But don't roar anymore."

13
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:59.823
Rex saw a crack.

14
00:00:59.824 --> 00:01:03.656
"Mike!" Rex said suddenly.

15
00:01:03.657 --> 00:01:06.289
Mike ran behind Annie.

16
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:12.201
Annie growled. "Rex! Do not—"

17
00:01:12.202 --> 00:01:17.049
"Mike, you can help," Rex said.

18
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.445
"But I'm tiny," Mike said.

19
00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:25.556
"You can slip out," Rex said.

20
00:01:25.557 --> 00:01:28.381
"And find help."

21
00:01:28.382 --> 00:01:33.756
Mike nodded. "Okay."

22
00:01:33.757 --> 00:01:36.671
He squeezed into the crack.

23
00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:40.369
He got stuck.

24
00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.977
Mike wiggled.

25
00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:46.065
Finally he got through!

26
00:01:46.066 --> 00:01:50.631
"Yay!" Annie and Rex said.

27
00:01:50.632 --> 00:01:52.983
More rocks fell.

28
00:01:52.984 --> 00:01:55.798
Rex gulped.

29
00:01:55.799 --> 00:02:01.226
"I hope Mike finds help!"

